# The Void Knights' Outpost and a schematic Pest Control island for replays. Not the real map.
#
# Facts:
#  - the outpost is map region 10537 (CodexPestControlPlugin.OUTPOST_REGION); the player starts in it
#  - landers need combat 40, 70 or 100 (novice, intermediate, veteran); the portals are purple
#    (west), blue (east), yellow (south-east) and red (south-west); the first shield drops 15
#    seconds in, the rest every 30 seconds (oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/Pest_Control)
#  - NPC, interface and varbit names are RuneLite's (net.runelite.api.gameval)

scene 2600 2600
skill ATTACK 60
skill STRENGTH 60
skill DEFENCE 60
skill HITPOINTS 60
at 2650 2650
login

# What the plaque on screen says.
watch kicker plaque.shown.kicker
watch headline plaque.shown.headline
watch detail plaque.shown.detail
